      "sizeLevel": 8,
      "infoBadge": {
        "content": "🟨 **System**: $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ where $A \\in \\mathbb{R}^{m \\times n}$.\n🟦 Gaussian elimination and row echelon forms.\n🟩 Invertibility: $\\det(A) \\neq 0 \\iff A^{-1}$ exists.",
        "createdAt": "2026-09-18T17:43:08.382Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-18T17:43:08.382Z",
        "scale": 1
      }
    },
    {
